Subject: [PATCH 06/10] [3.1.2] [M156] [FedCM] Return early in RedirectTo() if the
 navigation destroys it

Original change's description:
> [FedCM] Return early in RedirectTo() if the navigation destroys it
>
> RequestHandler::RedirectTo() navigates the RP's frame and then completes
> the request. The navigation can synchronously destroy the RP frame, and
> with it this RequestHandler, which was then used afterwards. Return
> early if that happens.
>
